{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "8f20334db34398ca9a22140dfbd09089c2a5915975cde9528ddb89f3c9687ef2", "ja": "なりたい理由", "zh": "想成为的理由", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7c86f86247dcbff126ef47766a986ac1782c252fa3f480619b3bf78bbd138d06", "ja": "昴の悩みは自分の姉である美希が原因では\nないかと考える星梨花。昴は千早と仲良く\nなれない事を正直に話し、星梨花もまた美希\nの立候補の秘密を話す。そして投票日前日。\n候補者たちによる所信表明演説が始まった。", "zh": "星梨花认为，昴的烦恼或许源于他的姐姐美希。昴坦诚地说出了自己与千早难以亲近的心结，星梨花也将美希参选的秘密告诉了他。就在投票前一天，各位候选人的施政纲领演讲开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1000_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "6637f9663aed1fac07ee2b4957959d07806e9d406d67f777fed57c1de17425ff", "ja": "あの、昴さん。昴さんが最近元気がないのって、\nわたしのお姉さまのせいなんでしょうか……？", "zh": "那个，昴姐姐。昴姐姐最近没什么精神，是因为我的姐姐吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "bb407d1d682fbc8fb72a8de344e00f6ad4aeb243d9ec8d1bb9dc407f18a40743", "ja": "え……ええ！？　な、なんでそうなるの？", "zh": "诶……诶！？为、为什么会变成这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "dd466cf708abc91721becf7b9a3c5783de58f4907cc517ba2b7d829767a7304b", "ja": "美希お姉さまが立候補したことで、千早さんが\nお友達とケンカしたって聞きました。それで……。", "zh": "我听说因为美希姐姐参选了，千早姐姐和朋友吵架了。然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "4daa9cb0d3783e82def006e8a3dfea6801d071fcebb553160f6db2c754cd46be", "ja": "ええ！？　そんなの、気にしなくていいよ。だって\nそれは、美希さんの自由だし。星梨花には関係ないし。", "zh": "诶！？不用在意那种事啦。因为那是美希小姐的自由，也和星梨花没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "b2aa519e1cde6c0b184266f3aa11c3debde7ddfa39dc7c1ac44aa18ac81ba841", "ja": "昴さん……。\nじゃあ最近、元気がないのは……？", "zh": "昴……\n那你最近没什么精神，是因为……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "3e42a6e7265a484480b3717893b41f44b9a9243b82e3f8a20027d3fc991610cf", "ja": "うん……わたし、千早さんとぜんぜん仲良く\nなれなくて。それで、言っちゃったんだ。", "zh": "嗯……我跟千早小姐完全搞不好\n关系。所以，我就说出口了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "fe4f1281797cb5ab924378b5ce4813dbe6801e74c5532ff86e08fcdb78bdb191", "ja": "姉妹になること、もう一度考えてほしいって。\n……わたし、生意気だったかな。", "zh": "希望她能重新考虑一下做姐妹的事情。\n……我是不是太不知天高地厚了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "6ceb8765906a8f397861cc7f4a87d57634333d836bd945b2c69c3bbd0b04e83b", "ja": "そんな……そんなこと、絶対にないです！\n……わたしも昴さんにだけ、秘密を打ち明けますね。", "zh": "怎么会……绝对不是那样！  \n……我也只把这个秘密告诉昴前辈哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "ff81a24b13ae85401bb29fd99d65db013ae3fa2dde17f717f27bfc1ea39bcd66", "ja": "わたしのお姉さまが立候補したのって、\n仇討ちなんだそうです。", "zh": "听说我姐姐之所以参选，\n是为了复仇呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "bbb70ed63b171c9821e6efbdb6681f6b4ea0e2f7322cd85a6521dbf31042cab4", "ja": "へ？　か、仇討ち？", "zh": "诶？报、报仇？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "556120d1008fd65195975ea52592ca6263768061f8bd7dd2f5caec1025723066", "ja": "はい。ミス・ローズ……麗花お姉さまは昨年、生徒\n会長選で、ミス・ラベンダーに負けてしまったんです。", "zh": "是的。蔷薇小姐……丽花姐姐去年在学生会长选举中输给了薰衣草小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "70b6db50cb840e292d9d578b532bb750f99cff344a7e71c0a410fe6f28cc55ec", "ja": "すこし前に、麗花お姉さまがおっしゃったんです。\n『生徒会長になってみたかったなあ』って。", "zh": "不久前，丽花姐姐说过：\n“真想试试看当上学生会长啊。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "0de245dc19fb94713145d245d9be52ad7e2919dace6f5e1954df2c7fa2136fe1", "ja": "だから仇討ちなんだって、美希お姉さまが。\n本当は、正しくないのかもしれないですけど……。", "zh": "所以，美希姐姐说这是为了报仇雪恨。  \n不过，这样做或许并不正确……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "ac114ae97b9464eb65f82f7d5da333d5ad1129f45ec045b98e13d8275c8293d0", "ja": "でもわたし、お姉さまに頑張ってほしいです。\n後悔してほしくないから……。", "zh": "但是，我还是希望姐姐能加油。\n因为我不希望她后悔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "2f89ca4549262c2db3ab4a35f1100b800e91279891c0e2bfb3a7b45e001d910d", "ja": "うん……そうだね。\nそういうきっかけだって、あるよね……。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。\n也会有那样的契机呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "6bde87c91cffe46f11a8db10e19c172535ff9924f8556467a9dcfc35e3ba4524", "ja": "その気持ちを応援したいっていうの、わかる。\n話してくれてありがとう、星梨花。", "zh": "我明白你想支持那份心情。\n谢谢你愿意告诉我，星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "eaa420d4e887753dd1be8a5eca2e15919f5ad33dbbc67ecc119131b2f196d819", "ja": "昴さん……わたしのほうこそ、\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "昴姐姐……我才是要说，\n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "a511632277ccfee7544ac7f1a7df7052785c84024ce94a90533dad6356fde2ee", "ja": "生徒会選挙、投票日前日。候補者達の\n所信表明演説のために、全校集会が開かれた。", "zh": "学生会选举投票日前一天。为了让候选人发表竞选宣言，学校召开了全校集会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "d3689f2065c2a17eb1d21d421c98d8a202c54b6fc1aeab32d6a7ca33809f1f41", "ja": "私が生徒会長になったら、学園の様々な活動に、\n生徒の意見を積極的に取り入れていきたいと思います。", "zh": "如果我当上学生会长，我希望能在学园的各种活动中，积极采纳同学们的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "54f48c326b502d788b3b6c9a1c93ca6ab1298b167275b1785151790d74046c55", "ja": "そのためには、皆さん……ううん、みんなの協力が\n絶対に必要です。どうぞよろしくお願いします、なの！", "zh": "为此，各位……不，是大家的协助绝对必不可少。还请多多关照哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "739afe99539576e921efcd5e3060bf969e92ba741b5d35eabc799de6291460e0", "ja": "（『仇討ち』って聞いた時はビックリしたけど、\nすごくちゃんとしてる。美希さんてすごいな……）", "zh": "（听到“复仇”的时候吓了一跳，不过没想到她做得这么认真。美希真厉害啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "5d7765bea3c6ebf1352547f51f57c2fca3d0076acdf47db5d3433ff9d5e10ed7", "ja": "（最後は、高坂さんの演説だ。\n……育も、緊張してるみたい……）", "zh": "（最后是高坂同学的演讲。……育好像也很紧张……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1024_029umi", "source_sha256": "2aefe7631bccffe4a9cdf12da06405e9822516eae2db8b2333dd89caa289f535", "ja": "あ、え、えっと。\nわっ……私が、生徒会長になったらっ……！", "zh": "啊，呃，那个。\n要、要是我当上学生会长的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "b08669286184247d27710cff66edb5d48e707bef6bdbaa0e6fd83032e77d4f9c", "ja": "！\n……海美さん、がんばってっ！", "zh": "！……海美姐姐，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "8c544897c1f0877dd422c4308ec6efc7e8a8d4680a74aa7d2bfe461f7fdf5833", "ja": "（そこから高坂さんは、用意していた原稿を置いて\n話し始めた。まっすぐ前を向いて、自分の言葉で……）", "zh": "（海美放下了事先准备好的稿子，开始发言。她直视前方，用自己的话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_07_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "cf4b57bcc83d9d624f5bd270da9c4c73f9f3f9ce0862527d8bad20d6a24d5e84", "ja": "（みんな高坂さんの言葉に、\n心を打たれているみたいだった）", "zh": "（大家好像都被海美的话打动了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
